                            Hmmm nice...but...
                      @{" How can the user flag files ??? " Link Howtoflag}
@endnode
@node Howtoflag " How can the user flag files ???  "

               You have asked me...here you get an answer...

They must press the @{" F " Link ich}[Flag-modus] in the NewScan and then the user see
white-in-blue colored filenames....now they can choose the files with 
the cursor-keys [up/down]...they can flag the files, if there press SPACE
at the marked filename. Now the bytes of the files will change into FLAGGED.
Now the file(s) are flagged.

              With the key `V` you can view into the file....

           @{" Hmmm that`s all ?? hmmm easy..bring me to the main menu " Link Main}
@{" STOP! One question! I didn`t understand...bring me back to the previous page! " Link Howcanitestit}
@endnode
