@node Command-N " T-NSCAN OPTIONS WITH THE COMMAND N "

      N................Start T-NS                            
      N -(x)...........Scans x-days back in the upload-dir          
      N -(x) A.........Like n -(x)  in all dirs                     
      N mm-dd-yy U.....Scans from the date-x in the upload-dir      
      N mm-dd-yy A.....Scans from the date-x in all dir             
      N S U............Scans uploads since last logon in upload-dir 
      N S A............Scans uploads since last logon in all dirs   
      N S U NS.........Like N S U with nonstop output [Break with Q]
      N S A NS.........Like N S A with nonstop output [Break with Q]
      N T U............Scans today uploads in upload-dir            
      N T A............Scans today uploads in all dirs              
      N T U NS.........Like N T U with nonstop output [Break with Q]
      N T A NS.........Like N T A with nonstop output [Break with Q]

      @{"  That looks good...bring me back...  " Link Howcanitestit}
@endnode      
@node Command-F " T-NSCAN OPTIONS WITH THE COMMAND F "

      F................Scans in filelist                            
      F A..............Scans all filelists                          
      F A NS...........Like F A with nonstop output [Break with Q]  
      F U..............Scans in upload-filelist                     
      F U NS...........Like F U with nonstop output [Break with Q]  
      F (x)............Scans in filelist x                          
      F (x) NS.........Like F (x) with nonstop output [Break with Q]

 @{"  Hmmm..ok...i`ve understand...now back, please  " Link Howcanitestit}
@endnode
@node Command-? " COMMANDS WHILE FILESCANNING AND DESCRIPTION "

 C: Clears the screen and scroll forwards
 F: Switch flag-modus on
 N: Output nonstop
 S: Skip current dir
 Q: Quit T-NS
UP: CURSOR-KEY UP    - Scroll one line up
DN: CURSOR-KEY DOWN  - Scroll one line down
LF: CURSOR-KEY LEFT  - clears the screen and goes up...short,
                       the screen will jump up
RG: CURSOR-KEY RIGHT - clears the screen and goes down ...short, 
                       the screen will jump down
BS: BACKSPACE       - the screen will scroll backward....
 1: Will go to the end of the shown dir
 2: Scroll one line forward
 3: clears the screen and goes down
 7: Will go to the top of the shown dir
 8: Scroll one line back
 9: clears the screen and goes up
 ?: short description of the commands
CR: RETURN/ENTER    - the screen will scroll down....

(004%)       - This tells you, how many percent of the dir was shown !!!

Flags: None  - This tells you, how many files are Flagged !!!

          @{"  yEAH...Bring me back sir...  " Link Howcanitestit}
@endnode
