      N S A............sCANS uPLOADS sINCE lAST lOGON iN aLL dIRS             
      N S U NS.........lIKE N S U wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]          
      N S A NS.........lIKE N S A wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]          
      N T U............sCANS tODAY uPLOADS iN uPLOAD-dIR                      
      N T A............sCANS tODAY uPLOADS iN aLL dIRS                        
      N T U NS.........lIKE N T U wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]          
      N T A NS.........lIKE N T A wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]          
                                                                              
--==========================================================================--
