      F................sCANS iN fILElIST                                      
      F A..............sCANS aLL fILElISTS                                    
      F A NS...........lIKE F A wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]            
      F U..............sCANS iN uPLOAD-fILElIST                               
      F U NS...........lIKE F U wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]            
      F (x)............sCANS iN fILElIST x                                    
      F (x) NS.........lIKE F (x) wITH nONSTOP oUTPUT [bREAK wITH Q]          
                                                                              
